ata:sn83030313:00271743555:1866091901:0970/172,2988,965,120/640,/0/default.jpg", "verbatim": "Our European files by the Moravian, dated to the 6th\ninst., reached this city from Quebec yesterday evening.", "lineage_id": "herald:L56d1e2b95c6a4979", "source": "herald", "url": "https://chroniclingamerica.loc.gov/lccn/sn83030313/1866-09-19/ed-1/seq-6/"}, {"mark": "14", "claim": "Brought news New York (last evening) news to 1866-09-06", "citation": "New York Herald, 19 September 1866, p. 10, col. 1", "source_kind": "newspaper", "displayable": true, "crop": "https://tile.loc.gov/image-services/iiif/service:ndnp:dlc:batch_dlc_houseleek_ver01:data:sn83030313:00271743555:1866091901:0974/113,1212,948,773/640,/0/default.jpg", "verbatim": "Our[?] European files by the Moravian reached this city\nfrom[?] Quebec last evening. The papers contain the fol-\nlowing[?] interesting, and somewhat important, details of\nour[?] telegraphic report from Father Point, as well as of\nour[?] cable despatches, to the 6th instant.", "lineage_id": "herald:Lb51de5e03f3a4a7b", "source": "herald", "url": "https://chroniclingamerica.loc.gov/lccn/sn83030313/1866-09-19/ed-1/seq-10/"}, {"mark": "15", "claim": "Brought news Father Point (to-day) news to 1866-09-07", "citation": "Evening Star (Washington), 17 September 1866, p. 2, col. 2", "source_kind": "newspaper", "displayable": true, "crop": "https://tile.loc.gov/image-services/iiif/service:ndnp:dlc:batch_dlc_leonberger_ver03:data:sn83045462:00280654279:1866091701:0321/1140,1422,1044,419/640,/0/default.jpg", "verbatim": "The steamer Mo-\nravian, from Liverpool on the 6th, via Lon-\ndonderry on the 7th, passed this point to-day.", "lineage_id": "star:L2892f4625d0ae09f", "source": "star", "url": "https://chroniclingamerica.loc.gov/lccn/sn83045462/1866-09-17/ed-1/seq-2/"}, {"mark": "16", "claim": "Brought news Quebec (y) news to 1866-09-06", "citation": "The Sun (New York), 19 September 1866, p. 1, col. 2", "source_kind": "newspaper", "displayable": true